{"words": [{"text": "وَلَمَّا", "translation": "And when"}, {"text": "جَآءَهُمْ", "translation": "came to them"}, {"text": "رَسُولٌۭ", "translation": "a Messenger"}, {"text": "مِّنْ", "translation": "(of)"}, {"text": "عِندِ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "مُصَدِّقٌۭ", "translation": "confirming"}, {"text": "لِّمَا", "translation": "what"}, {"text": "مَعَهُمْ", "translation": "(was) with them"}, {"text": "نَبَذَ", "translation": "threw away"}, {"text": "فَرِيقٌۭ", "translation": "a party"}, {"text": "مِّنَ", "translation": "of"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those who"}, {"text": "أُوتُوا۟", "translation": "were given"}, {"text": "ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ", "translation": "the Book"}, {"text": "كِتَـٰبَ", "translation": "(the) Book"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "(of) Allah"}, {"text": "وَرَآءَ", "translation": "behind"}, {"text": "ظُهُورِهِمْ", "translation": "their backs"}, {"text": "كَأَنَّهُمْ", "translation": "as if they"}, {"text": "لَا", "translation": "(do) not"}, {"text": "يَعْلَمُونَ", "translation": "know"}], "sahih": "And when a messenger from Allāh came to them confirming that which was with them, a party of those who had been given the Scripture threw the Scripture of Allāh [i.e., the Torah] behind their backs as if they did not know [what it contained]."}